{"id": "EUVD-2026-74929", "enisaUuid": "9e9a10c1-351a-34c8-b2c2-2edf99986e87", "description": "snipe-it versions before 8.7.0 fail to enforce per-instance FMCS scoping in asset audit endpoints, relying solely on query-layer filtering instead of policy-layer authorization checks. Attackers with valid sessions and assets.audit permissions could write audit log entries against cross-company assets if the query-layer scope were bypassed or refactored.", "datePublished": "2026-09-09T13:32:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-10T14:57:38", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/grokability/snipe-it/security/advisories/GHSA-q745-gx2m-xj93", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/snipe-it-before-8.7.0-authorization-bypass-via-asset-audit-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-86752", "GHSA-4824-pg37-xwx7"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4942b749-32a7-3ef3-9e7e-20fed8fb6f44", "product": {"name": "snipe-it", "vendor": {"name": "Grokability, Inc."}}, "product_version": "0 <8.7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4f84dec4-6d4b-3fd9-8c14-a9332f2cd201", "vendor": {"name": "grokability"}}], "isExploited": false}